msgstr "Sulge aken"

#: crates/obscure-app/src/ui/shortcuts-dialog.blp:29
#: crates/obscure-app/src/tray.rs:101
msgid "Quit"
msgstr "Välju"

#: crates/obscure-app/src/ui/preferences-dialog.blp:14
msgid "Behavior"
msgstr "Käitumine"

#: crates/obscure-app/src/ui/preferences-dialog.blp:17
msgid "Keep running in the background"
msgstr "Jätka taustal töötamist"

#: crates/obscure-app/src/ui/preferences-dialog.blp:18
msgid "Closing the window leaves Obscure in the tray, still connected."
msgstr "Akna sulgemine jätab Obscure'i salve, endiselt ühendatuna."

#: crates/obscure-app/src/ui/preferences-dialog.blp:22
msgid "Start with the session"
msgstr "Käivita koos seansiga"

#: crates/obscure-app/src/ui/preferences-dialog.blp:23
msgid "Obscure opens in the tray when you log in."
msgstr "Obscure avaneb sisselogimisel salves."

#: crates/obscure-app/src/ui/preferences-dialog.blp:27
msgid "Connect when Obscure starts"
msgstr "Ühendu Obscure'i käivitumisel"

#: crates/obscure-app/src/ui/preferences-dialog.blp:32
msgid "Connection"
msgstr "Ühendus"

#: crates/obscure-app/src/ui/preferences-dialog.blp:33
msgid ""
"Changes apply the next time you connect. If you are connected now, Obscure "
"reconnects."
msgstr ""
"Muudatused jõustuvad järgmisel ühendumisel. Kui oled praegu ühendatud, "
"ühendub Obscure uuesti."

#: crates/obscure-app/src/ui/preferences-dialog.blp:36
msgid "Local port"
msgstr "Kohalik port"

#: crates/obscure-app/src/ui/preferences-dialog.blp:37
msgid "Where programs on this computer reach the connection."
msgstr "Kus selle arvuti programmid ühenduse leiavad."

#: crates/obscure-app/src/ui/preferences-dialog.blp:49
msgid "DNS server (DNS over HTTPS)"
msgstr "DNS-server (DNS üle HTTPS-i)"

#: crates/obscure-app/src/ui/preferences-dialog.blp:56
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Täpsemalt"

#: crates/obscure-app/src/ui/preferences-dialog.blp:60
msgid "Shortcut"
msgstr "Kiirklahv"

#: crates/obscure-app/src/ui/preferences-dialog.blp:63
msgid "System-wide shortcut to connect or disconnect"
msgstr "Süsteemiülene kiirklahv ühendamiseks või katkestamiseks"

#: crates/obscure-app/src/ui/preferences-dialog.blp:64
msgid "Works even when Obscure is hidden. The system lets you choose the keys."
msgstr "Töötab ka siis, kui Obscure on peidetud. Klahvid valid süsteemis."

#: crates/obscure-app/src/ui/preferences-dialog.blp:69
msgid "Route rules"
msgstr "Marsruutimisreeglid"

#: crates/obscure-app/src/ui/preferences-dialog.blp:70
msgid ""
"Your rules win over the preset. Use a domain (example.com), an address "
"(10.0.0.0/8) or a category (geosite:netflix)."
msgstr ""
"Sinu reeglid on eelseadistusest tähtsamad. Kasuta domeeni (example.com), "
"aadressi (10.0.0.0/8) või kategooriat (geosite:netflix)."

#: crates/obscure-app/src/ui/preferences-dialog.blp:75
msgid "Add rule"
msgstr "Lisa reegel"

#: crates/obscure-app/src/ui/preferences-dialog.blp:94
msgid "Engine configuration"
msgstr "Mootori seadistus"

#: crates/obscure-app/src/ui/preferences-dialog.blp:97
msgid "Edit the engine configuration"
msgstr "Muuda mootori seadistust"

#: crates/obscure-app/src/ui/preferences-dialog.blp:98
msgid "See or replace the JSON that Obscure sends to Xray."
msgstr "Vaata või asenda JSON, mille Obscure Xrayle saadab."

#: crates/obscure-app/src/ui/import-dialog.blp:17
#: crates/obscure-app/src/window.rs:550 crates/obscure-app/src/window.rs:579
#: crates/obscure-app/src/window.rs:691
#: crates/obscure-app/src/preferences_dialog.rs:234
