msgid ""
"This subscription is in Clash format, which Obscure does not support yet."
msgstr "See tellimus on Clash-vormingus, mida Obscure veel ei toeta."

#: crates/obscure-app/src/humanize.rs:60
msgid ""
"Tunnel mode is not possible here: the engine is stored on a filesystem that "
"ignores permissions (nosuid)."
msgstr ""
"Tunnelirežiim pole siin võimalik: mootor asub failisüsteemis, mis eirab "
"õigusi (nosuid)."

